*.pyc

# Marketplace install artifacts. Installing a plugin from this repo's own
# marketplace copies plugins/<name> to /<name>/<version>/ and writes an
# .in_use marker inside it. The source of truth is plugins/.
/nano-banana/
/pr-review-loop/
